  2026-09-16 11:00  40 req / 9162  = exactly 2 passes (2x20 req, 2x4581 ch)
                                     -> verify run 1, both renders, failed at the mux compare
  2026-09-16 13:00  66 req / 15806 = 3 passes + 6 requests / 2063 ch
