                                        read timeout after 6 English scenes) + verify run 3 (a+b)
  2026-09-15 15:00  14 req / 3508  = an earlier draft of the script; engine split not derivable
  14 + 40 + 66 = 120 requests, and the three clusters match the session's history exactly.

